@startuml
title TutorLink - Planteamiento del problema y propuesta de centralizacion

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor Docente
actor Estudiante
actor "Tutor academico" as tutor
actor "Padre, madre o\ntutor legal" as guardian

package "Situacion actual: informacion dispersa" #FFF4E5 {
  cloud "Correo\nelectronico" as email
  cloud "Mensajeria\ninstantanea" as messaging
  database "Hojas de calculo\ny registros aislados" as spreadsheets
  folder "Plataformas y\nmedios separados" as platforms
}

rectangle "Consecuencias" #FDE2E2 {
  component "Dificultad para conocer\ntareas y entregas" as problem_tasks
  component "Seguimiento tardio de\ninasistencias y pendientes" as problem_tracking
  component "Comunicacion fragmentada\nentre participantes" as problem_communication
  component "Duplicidad o perdida\nde informacion" as problem_data
}

rectangle "TutorLink: entorno centralizado y personalizable" #E6F4EA {
  component "Usuarios y roles\npor institucion" as solution_users
  component "Tutorias y consultas\ncon docentes" as solution_communication
  component "Clases, materiales,\ntareas y entregas" as solution_academic
  component "Asistencia, progreso\ny alertas preventivas" as solution_tracking
  component "Notificaciones para\nusuarios y familias" as solution_notifications
}

Docente --> email
Docente --> spreadsheets
Estudiante --> messaging
Estudiante --> platforms
tutor --> email
tutor --> spreadsheets
guardian --> messaging

email --> problem_communication
messaging --> problem_communication
spreadsheets --> problem_tasks
spreadsheets --> problem_tracking
platforms --> problem_data

problem_tasks --> solution_academic : centraliza
problem_tracking --> solution_tracking : permite detectar
problem_communication --> solution_communication : integra
problem_data --> solution_users : controla acceso

Docente --> solution_academic
Docente --> solution_tracking
Estudiante --> solution_academic
Estudiante --> solution_communication
tutor --> solution_communication
tutor --> solution_tracking
guardian --> solution_notifications
guardian --> solution_tracking

solution_academic --> solution_notifications
solution_tracking --> solution_notifications

note bottom of solution_users
Cada institucion mantiene usuarios, datos y
configuracion separados logicamente.
end note

@enduml
